 from a scrapyard in Vancouver to the Orthodox Jewish community of Bnei Brak and back to a decaying farm in rural Manitoba. Each discovery adds to the visual and narrative collage, building to a surprising and thought-provoking conclusion that invites us to explore our own personal stories.   ", "short_description": "Blood Relations is a whimsical VR documentary about an adopted child and a quest to solve an ancestral mystery."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Portrait1008x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "3185431641772787", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974676_3185431645106120_7305487962040821417_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=T42Q974a1-UQ7kNvwHreXii&_nc_oc=AdpWfmBotF-oMw8D87Plc7Z5W54lkkxOQ1dItPI8OZsYb5jtKVN4CHZfO0xo9DDVbDc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLbNbwMZlxQi4wPzK9QYrdt026ns-QRrxzAtkXy0V7-nw&oe=6AA178C1"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_TrCoverImage2560x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "2112431928963685", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974453_2112431932297018_1168886450594301820_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Fc9Ti4z2f20Q7kNvwFwsBgK&_nc_oc=Adp8FwPnSrcn1IiJLrVHC0bxsmxbM2OGDQ5sp0NiWjKP6vNsjorPHUdE13gSsLuLUbU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIKxpAS8XqgBQt_1Et9IexSY5GBNMJd_0K9PqpVU5NIxQ&oe=6AA14DE6"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Square1440x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "1965493300326997", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262745_1965493303660330_6562698748019357103_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gZ-Fwe_GUjUQ7kNvwG3wRpb&_nc_oc=Ado3IXPchZpE8YCeZiXxhWWjmq9C7nIRf-CZqqU5Z9ibTLaknwq1lqUmo82mqMt3kO4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIBOJXreJqiTfzx9KnyqgighSFwWXcxwLPHWZFXT2B0mA&oe=6AA157DC"}, {"fil